            "heading": "Material Matters: Finding the Safest Option",
            "text": "<p>Not all piercing jewelry is created equal! Choosing high-quality materials is essential for safety, longevity, and comfort. Here's a breakdown of the best options:</p><ul><li>Titanium – Lightweight, hypoallergenic, and perfect for sensitive skin.</li><li>Surgical Stainless Steel – A durable and cost-effective choice for healed piercings.</li><li>Solid Gold (14K & Higher) – Elegant and safe, but best for fully healed piercings.</li><li>Bioplast & PTFE – Flexible and ideal for anyone with a metal sensitivity.</li></ul>"
