            "heading": "Factors to Consider When Choosing Jewelry:",
            "text": "<ul><li>Jewelry Type Matters: Hoops, studs, and barbells all serve different purposes—choose based on your piercing placement.</li><li>Find the Perfect Fit: The wrong size can cause irritation or migration—always consult a professional for measurements.</li><li>Match Your Style: Opt for a piece that suits your everyday look, whether that's understated or statement-making.</li></ul>"
